  m_text: '3. Sharing Data with Third Parties

    We may share your data with:

    -Business
    partners

    -Service providers

    -Advertisers

    -Research and analytics
    companies

    -Other third parties of our choosing

    -Our friends


    Data
    may be shared both within and outside the EU to countries where the level of
    data protection may differ significantly. We do not guarantee that third parties
    will handle the data with the same level of care as we do.'
